      "id": "P_CONVERSION_RESET_AND_PREVIOUS_WORD",
      "observable_contract": "Each rising `clks` crossing publishes the previous P-side state as dout3=dp4, dout2=dp3, dout1=dp2, and dout0=dp1, then initializes dp4=dm4=0 and every remaining undecided P/M pair to 1/1 for a new conversion.",
