      "observable_contract": "Decisions update dp4/dm4 through dp1/dm1 in MSB-to-LSB order. dcomp-high/dcompb-low selects P/M=1/0 and the opposite comparator polarity selects P/M=0/1; undecided trial pairs may remain equal-valued.",
